    "title": "Police arrest 1, search for second suspect after Texarkana shooting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paulina Mata ,\n6 hours ago\nTEXARKANA, Texas ( KETK ) — Texarkana police have arrested one suspect and are searching for a second after a shooting on Wednesday that left several homes hit by gunfire.\nMarshall police arrest 2 in overnight shooting on Circle Drive Texarkana Police Department officers responded to a call of reported gunfire in the area of Anthony and Yale Streets at approximately 10 a.m. on Wednesday.\nOnce arriving on the scene, officers found that several homes in the area had been hit by gunfire and no injuries were reported, according to the Texarkana Police Department.\nFurther investigation showed that Ikee Wyrick, 33, and another man fired multiple shots at each other from their vehicles as they drove down the street in an ongoing dispute.\nOfficers arrested Wyrick at the scene on the charge of deadly conduct.\nThough the officers were unable to locate the second suspect, his identity is known and a warrant is currently being obtained for his arrest on the same charge, the Texarkana Police Department said.",
